       "v": "This is the map for the day; put it back on screen at each module transition. Each level adds something: L2 adds clarity, L3 adds context that persists, L4 adds process, L5 adds autonomy. Make the point that higher is not always better: a simple email needs Level 2, not an agent. The pro skill is choosing the right level for the task. Ask: \"Where are you today?\" Most will say 1, a few 2."
