       "k": "text",
       "v": "Prepare this in advance and test it (see facilitator guide, Demo 1). Pick a niche, specific question from your industry or market; niche questions bring out errors more reliably. In run 1, look for specific numbers and sources that sound real. Click or search for them live. In run 2, show the difference: links, hedging, maybe \"limited data\". If run 1 happens to be correct, that is fine too: the lesson is that "
